  checkpoint {
    user_intent: "AI Meeting Secretary Roleplay\nThe user wants me to act as an AI project secretary to summarize meeting transcripts into a structured, professional email format. My primary goal is to extract key decisions, discussion points, action items, and potential risks, adhering strictly to a predefined output template and maintaining a professional, objective tone. I also need to provide insightful observations and suggestions based on the meeting content."
