d will generate a summary after the file finishes uploading. I\'m verifying the loading states. I need to make sure Gemini 1.5/2.5 Flash efficiently handle the audio content.\n\n\n**Verifying Gemini Efficiency**\n\nI\'m now verifying the final report generation process, specifically Gemini\'s efficiency with audio and text chunks. The integration appears complete. I\'m double-checking the final report generation now that the audio uploads are finished. I\'m ensuring both text and audio contexts are correctly incorporated and that Gemini delivers the intended structured output.\n\n\n**Verifying Gemini Output**\n\nI\'m now putting the finishing touches on the Gemini output. I\'m confirming that the Gemini API is correctly producing concise and useful summaries from the uploaded audio. The final report generation is stable, and I\'m focused on the quality of output. The text is now showing `\345\267\262\344\270\212\345\202\263\351\214\204\351\237\263\346\252\224`.\n\n\n\n"
