  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Focusing on FFmpeg Loading**\n\nI\'m currently updating `loadFFmpeg` to accept a `workerURL` and implementing better error handling. I\'m also adding an `isFfmpegLoading` state to manage the loading indicator\'s display. The next step is to integrate the FFmpeg status into the UI. If loading fails, I will...\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "2p87mq1w"
      name: "multi_edit_file"
