  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Error Handling**\n\nI\'ve decided to refine the error handling. Rather than immediately throwing errors, my code will patiently wait for `ffmpegLoaded` to be true if `isFfmpegLoading` is also true. I\'m exploring a polling or promise-based approach for the wait. In addition, I will update the user interface to disable the upload button or provide visual feedback during FFmpeg loading to improve the user experience.\n\n\n"
