  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Optimizing CDN & Upload**\n\nI\'m switching the CDN to jsdelivr for improved reliability and speed. Also, I\'ve doubled the file upload timeout to 60 seconds to accommodate potentially larger files. I\'m investigating a progress indicator for file loading; it\'s tricky since FFmpeg doesn\'t offer direct progress updates, but I\'ll see what\'s feasible.\n\n\n**Refining FFmpeg Loading**\n\nI\'ve decided to refine the FFmpeg loading process. I\'m modifying `loadFFmpeg` to prioritize jsdelivr and use unpkg as a fallback. This will make use of the fact that `toBlobURL` could prove slow, so this will minimize blocking. I also plan to add error handling within the CDN loading loop. I\'m investigating better feedback to the user on the progress of operations as well.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "ykerjtnk"
      name: "multi_edit_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Instruction\":\"Implement CDN fallback for FFmpeg loading and increase timeout to 60 seconds.\",\"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"ReplacementContent\":\"  const loadFFmpeg = async () => {\\n    setIsFfmpegLoading(true);\\n    setFfmpegError(false);\\n    \\n    const cdns = [\\n      \'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@ffmpeg/core@0.12.6/dist/umd\',\\n      \'https://unpkg.com/@ffmpeg/core@0.12.6/dist/umd\'\\n    ];\\n    \\n    const ffmpeg = ffmpegRef.current;\\n    \\n    // Add progress listener to show it\'s working\\n    ffmpeg.on(\'log\', ({ message }) => {\\n      console.log(\'FFmpeg Log:\', message);\\n    });\\n\\n    let loaded = false;\\n    for (const baseURL of cdns) {\\n      try {\\n        console.log(`Attempting to load FFmpeg from ${baseURL}...`);\\n        await ffmpeg.load({\\n          coreURL: await toBlobURL(`${baseURL}/ffmpeg-core.js`, \'text/javascript\'),\\n          wasmURL: await toBlobURL(`${baseURL}/ffmpeg-core.wasm`, \'application/wasm\'),\\n        });\\n        loaded = true;\\n        console.log(`FFmpeg loaded successfully from ${baseURL}`);\\n        break;\\n      } catch (err) {\\n        console.warn(`Failed to load FFmpeg from ${baseURL}`, err);\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    if (loaded) {\\n      setFfmpegLoaded(true);\\n      ffmpegLoadedRef.current = true;\\n      setIsFfmpegLoading(false);\\n    } else {\\n      setFfmpegError(true);\\n      setIsFfmpegLoading(false);\\n    }\\n  };\",\"TargetContent\":\"  const loadFFmpeg = async () => {\\n    setIsFfmpegLoading(true);\\n    setFfmpegError(false);\\n    const baseURL = \'https://unpkg.com/@ffmpeg/core@0.12.6/dist/umd\';\\n    const ffmpeg = ffmpegRef.current;\\n    \\n    // Add progress listener to show it\'s working\\n    ffmpeg.on(\'log\', ({ message }) => {\\n      console.log(\'FFmpeg Log:\', message);\\n    });\\n\\n    try {\\n      await ffmpeg.load({\\n        coreURL: await toBlobURL(`${baseURL}/ffmpeg-core.js`, \'text/javascript\'),\\n        wasmURL: await toBlobURL(`${baseURL}/ffmpeg-core.wasm`, \'application/wasm\'),\\n      });\\n      setFfmpegLoaded(true);\\n      ffmpegLoadedRef.current = true;\\n      setIsFfmpegLoading(false);\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      console.error(\'FFmpeg load failed\', err);\\n      setFfmpegError(true);\\n      setIsFfmpegLoading(false);\\n    }\\n  };\"},{\"ReplacementContent\":\"        if (isFfmpegLoading && !ffmpegLoadedRef.current) {\\n          setChunks(prev => prev.map(c => c.id === statusChunkId ? { ...c, text: `\350\231\225\347\220\206\347\265\204\344\273\266\350\274\211\345\205\245\344\270\255\357\274\214\350\253\213\347\250\215\345\200\231...` } : c));\\n          \\n          // Wait for ffmpegLoadedRef.current to become true (max 60 seconds)\\n          let waitTime = 0;\\n          while (!ffmpegLoadedRef.current && waitTime < 60) {\\n            await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 1000));\\n            waitTime++;\\n            // If it failed during wait, break early\\n            if (ffmpegError) break;\\n          }\\n          \\n          if (!ffmpegLoadedRef.current) {\\n            throw new Error(\'\350\231\225\347\220\206\347\265\204\344\273\266\350\274\211\345\205\245\350\266\205\346\231\202\346\210\226\345\244\261\346\225\227\357\274\214\350\253\213\346\252\242\346\237\245\347\266\262\350\267\257\351\200\243\347\267\232\344\270\246\351\207\215\346\226\260\346\225\264\347\220\206\351\240\201\351\235\242\343\200\202\');\\n          }\\n        }\",\"TargetContent\":\"        if (isFfmpegLoading && !ffmpegLoadedRef.current) {\\n          setChunks(prev => prev.map(c => c.id === statusChunkId ? { ...c, text: `\350\231\225\347\220\206\347\265\204\344\273\266\350\274\211\345\205\245\344\270\255\357\274\214\350\253\213\347\250\215\345\200\231...` } : c));\\n          \\n          // Wait for ffmpegLoadedRef.current to become true (max 30 seconds)\\n          let waitTime = 0;\\n          while (!ffmpegLoadedRef.current && waitTime < 30) {\\n            await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 1000));\\n            waitTime++;\\n          }\\n          \\n          if (!ffmpegLoadedRef.current) {\\n            throw new Error(\'\350\231\225\347\220\206\347\265\204\344\273\266\350\274\211\345\205\245\350\266\205\346\231\202\357\274\214\350\253\213\346\252\242\346\237\245\347\266\262\350\267\257\351\200\243\347\267\232\344\270\246\351\207\215\346\226\260\346\225\264\347\220\206\351\240\201\351\235\242\343\200\202\');\\n          }\\n        }\"}],\"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\",\"toolSummary\":\"Implement CDN fallback for FFmpeg and increase timeout to 60s.\"}"
