  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Model Compatibility**\n\nI\'m currently investigating a 404 error when attempting to use the `gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-12-2025` model with the Gemini API. The error message indicates the model is either unavailable or incompatible with `generateContent`. I will now look into supported model names to ensure compatibility for this API call.\n\n\n**Reassessing Model Support**\n\nI\'ve re-examined the instructions and confirmed the `gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-12-2025` model\'s inclusion, but the 404 error persists. I am considering potential environment constraints or compatibility issues. I\'m now exploring alternative models like `gemini-2.5-flash` to evaluate if this resolves the error. I\'m also considering `gemini-3-flash-preview` since it\'s also on the list.\n\n\n**Confirming Model Availability**\n\nI\'ve re-reviewed the model options in the Gemini API documentation again. I\'ve re-identified `gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-12-2025` as the target, but I see now the error explicitly indicates it\'s not found. So, I will try a couple of different approaches, including trying `gemini-3-flash-preview` instead for the chunks, or `gemini-2.5-flash`. I think the issue is the availability.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "ypxenri1"
      name: "edit_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Instruction\":\"Switch audio analysis model back to gemini-3-flash-preview to fix 404 error.\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"  const analyzeChunk = async (chunk: Chunk) => {\\n    if (!chunk.audio) return;\\n    try {\\n      // Use gemini-3-flash-preview for audio analysis as it is widely available and supports multimodal\\n      const response = await ai.models.generateContent({\\n        model: \'gemini-3-flash-preview\',\\n        contents: {\\n          parts: [\\n            { inlineData: { mimeType: chunk.audio.mimeType, data: chunk.audio.data } },\\n            { text: \'\350\253\213\350\201\275\351\200\231\346\256\265\351\214\204\351\237\263\357\274\214\344\270\246\347\260\241\350\246\201\347\270\275\347\265\220\351\207\215\351\273\236\343\200\201\346\261\272\350\255\260\350\210\207\345\276\205\350\276\246\344\272\213\351\240\205\343\200\202\' }\\n          ]\\n        }\\n      });\\n      setChunks(prev => prev.map(c => c.id === chunk.id ? { ...c, summary: response.text, isAnalyzing: false } : c));\\n    } catch (err: any) {\\n      console.error(\'Gemini API Error (Audio):\', err);\\n      const errorDetail = err.message || \'\345\210\206\346\236\220\345\244\261\346\225\227\';\\n      setChunks(prev => prev.map(c => c.id === chunk.id ? { ...c, summary: `\345\210\206\346\236\220\345\244\261\346\225\227: ${errorDetail}`, isAnalyzing: false } : c));\\n    }\\n  };\",\"TargetContent\":\"  const analyzeChunk = async (chunk: Chunk) => {\\n    if (!chunk.audio) return;\\n    try {\\n      // Use specialized audio model for better performance and reliability with audio files\\n      const response = await ai.models.generateContent({\\n        model: \'gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-12-2025\',\\n        contents: {\\n          parts: [\\n            { inlineData: { mimeType: chunk.audio.mimeType, data: chunk.audio.data } },\\n            { text: \'\350\253\213\350\201\275\351\200\231\346\256\265\351\214\204\351\237\263\357\274\214\344\270\246\347\260\241\350\246\201\347\270\275\347\265\220\351\207\215\351\273\236\343\200\201\346\261\272\350\255\260\350\210\207\345\276\205\350\276\246\344\272\213\351\240\205\343\200\202\' }\\n          ]\\n        }\\n      });\\n      setChunks(prev => prev.map(c => c.id === chunk.id ? { ...c, summary: response.text, isAnalyzing: false } : c));\\n    } catch (err: any) {\\n      console.error(\'Gemini API Error (Audio):\', err);\\n      const errorDetail = err.message || \'\345\210\206\346\236\220\345\244\261\346\225\227\';\\n      setChunks(prev => prev.map(c => c.id === chunk.id ? { ...c, summary: `\345\210\206\346\236\220\345\244\261\346\225\227: ${errorDetail}`, isAnalyzing: false } : c));\\n    }\\n  };\",\"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\",\"toolSummary\":\"Fix 404 error by switching back to gemini-3-flash-preview.\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
    }
