    thinking: "**Refining Implementation Strategy**\n\nI\'m currently focused on implementing retry logic for the `analyzeChunk` function. I will be increasing the delay in `processFileBySlicing` to accommodate this. Moreover, I\'m working to make the prompt more explicit to improve accuracy.\n\n\n**Implementing Rate Limiting**\n\nI\'ve added retry logic for rate limiting on the Gemini API calls, specifically handling the \"429\" errors or \"RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED\" statuses. The retry mechanism now includes an exponential backoff with delays of 3, 6, and 12 seconds. If an audio chunk generates an error, it is re-analyzed after a delay. This should improve robustness.\n\n\n"
