  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining the Transcript Process**\n\nI\'m currently focused on modifying the `Chunk` interface to incorporate a `transcript` field. My next step involves updating the `analyzeChunk` function to prioritize the transcription of audio into text. I\'m also preparing to update the `generateFinalReport` function to synthesize the meeting record from all chunk transcripts. This should streamline the overall workflow.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Transcription**\n\nI\'ve just updated the `Chunk` interface, adding a `transcript` field to store the transcribed text. The `analyzeChunk` function is now being modified to prioritize audio transcription using a Gemini model, before any analysis. The aim is a more efficient pipeline, and I am keen to see it in action!\n\n\n**Focusing on Transcript Generation**\n\nI\'ve successfully integrated the transcription logic into the `analyzeChunk` function. Using a Gemini model, I am extracting text from audio now. I am also preparing to update the `generateFinalReport` function to use the text transcripts. My next step will be to test and refine the transcription process with different audio inputs.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "p1pe7z9w"
      name: "multi_edit_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Instruction\":\"Modify the workflow to focus on transcription per chunk first, then perform a full meeting analysis at the end.\",\"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"ReplacementContent\":\"interface Chunk {\\n  id: number;\\n  text: string;\\n  transcript?: string;\\n  summary?: string;\\n  isAnalyzing: boolean;\\n  audio?: {\\n    fileName: string;\\n    mimeType: string;\\n    data: string;\\n  };\\n}\",\"TargetContent\":\"interface Chunk {\\n  id: number;\\n  text: string;\\n  summary?: string;\\n  isAnalyzing: boolean;\\n  audio?: {\\n    fileName: string;\\n    mimeType: string;\\n    data: string;\\n  };\\n}\"},{\"ReplacementContent\":\"  const analyzeChunk = async (chunk: Chunk, retryCount = 0): Promise<void> => {\\n    if (!chunk.audio) return;\\n    try {\\n      // Use the native audio model for the most stable and accurate transcription\\n      const response = await ai.models.generateContent({\\n        model: \'gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-12-2025\',\\n        contents: {\\n          parts: [\\n            { inlineData: { mimeType: chunk.audio.mimeType, data: chunk.audio.data } },\\n            { text: \'\350\253\213\345\260\207\351\200\231\346\256\265\351\237\263\350\250\212\345\205\247\345\256\271\347\262\276\346\272\226\350\275\211\351\214\204\347\202\272\351\200\220\345\255\227\347\250\277\343\200\202\350\253\213\347\233\264\346\216\245\350\274\270\345\207\272\345\260\215\350\251\261\345\205\247\345\256\271\357\274\214\344\270\215\351\234\200\350\246\201\344\273\273\344\275\225\351\226\213\345\240\264\347\231\275\346\210\226\350\247\243\351\207\213\343\200\202\' }\\n          ]\\n        }\\n      });\\n      setChunks(prev => prev.map(c => c.id === chunk.id ? { ...c, transcript: response.text, isAnalyzing: false } : c));\\n    } catch (err: any) {\\n      console.error(\'Gemini API Error (Audio):\', err);\\n      \\n      const errorMsg = err.message || \'\';\\n      if (errorMsg.includes(\'429\') || err.status === \'RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED\') {\\n        if (retryCount < 3) {\\n          const delay = Math.pow(2, retryCount) * 10000; \\n          console.log(`Rate limited. Retrying in ${delay}ms... (Attempt ${retryCount + 1})`);\\n          await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, delay));\\n          return analyzeChunk(chunk, retryCount + 1);\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      const errorDetail = errorMsg || \'\350\275\211\351\214\204\345\244\261\346\225\227\';\\n      setChunks(prev => prev.map(c => c.id === chunk.id ? { ...c, transcript: `\350\275\211\351\214\204\345\244\261\346\225\227: ${errorDetail}`, isAnalyzing: false } : c));\\n    }\\n  };\",\"TargetContent\":\"  const analyzeChunk = async (chunk: Chunk, retryCount = 0): Promise<void> => {\\n    if (!chunk.audio) return;\\n    try {\\n      // Use the native audio model for best audio understanding\\n      const response = await ai.models.generateContent({\\n        model: \'gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-12-2025\',\\n        contents: {\\n          parts: [\\n            { inlineData: { mimeType: chunk.audio.mimeType, data: chunk.audio.data } },\\n            { text: \'\351\200\231\346\230\257\344\270\200\346\256\265\346\234\203\350\255\260\351\214\204\351\237\263\343\200\202\350\253\213\344\273\224\347\264\260\350\201\206\350\201\275\344\270\246\345\260\207\345\205\266\345\205\247\345\256\271\350\275\211\351\214\204\347\202\272\351\200\220\345\255\227\347\250\277\357\274\214\347\204\266\345\276\214\347\270\275\347\265\220\351\207\215\351\273\236\343\200\201\346\261\272\350\255\260\350\210\207\345\276\205\350\276\246\344\272\213\351\240\205\343\200\202\' }\\n          ]\\n        }\\n      });\\n      setChunks(prev => prev.map(c => c.id === chunk.id ? { ...c, summary: response.text, isAnalyzing: false } : c));\\n    } catch (err: any) {\\n      console.error(\'Gemini API Error (Audio):\', err);\\n      \\n      // Handle 429 Resource Exhausted with exponential backoff retry\\n      const errorMsg = err.message || \'\';\\n      if (errorMsg.includes(\'429\') || err.status === \'RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED\') {\\n        if (retryCount < 3) {\\n          const delay = Math.pow(2, retryCount) * 10000; // 10s, 20s, 40s\\n          console.log(`Rate limited. Retrying in ${delay}ms... (Attempt ${retryCount + 1})`);\\n          await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, delay));\\n          return analyzeChunk(chunk, retryCount + 1);\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      const errorDetail = errorMsg || \'\345\210\206\346\236\220\345\244\261\346\225\227\';\\n      setChunks(prev => prev.map(c => c.id === chunk.id ? { ...c, summary: `\345\210\206\346\236\220\345\244\261\346\225\227: ${errorDetail}`, isAnalyzing: false } : c));\\n    }\\n  };\"},{\"ReplacementContent\":\"  const generateFinalReport = async () => {\\n    if (chunks.length === 0 && !currentChunkText.trim()) return;\\n    setIsGeneratingFinal(true);\\n    \\n    // Combine all transcripts for a comprehensive analysis\\n    const fullTranscript = chunks\\n      .map((c, i) => `\343\200\220\345\210\206\346\256\265 ${i + 1} \351\200\220\345\255\227\347\250\277\343\200\221\\\\n${c.transcript || c.text || \'(\347\204\241\345\205\247\345\256\271)\'}`)\\n      .join(\'\\\\n\\\\n\');\\n\\n    try {\\n      const response = await ai.models.generateContent({\\n        model: \'gemini-3.1-pro-preview\',\\n        contents: `\344\273\245\344\270\213\346\230\257\345\256\214\346\225\264\347\232\204\346\234\203\350\255\260\351\200\220\345\255\227\347\250\277\345\205\247\345\256\271\357\274\214\350\253\213\346\240\271\346\223\232\351\200\231\344\272\233\345\205\247\345\256\271\347\224\242\345\207\272\347\265\220\346\247\213\345\214\226\346\234\203\350\255\260\347\264\200\351\214\204\357\274\232\\\\n\\\\n${fullTranscript}`,\\n        config: { systemInstruction: SYSTEM_PROMPT }\\n      });\\n      setFinalReport(response.text || \'\');\\n    } catch (e: any) {\\n      console.error(\'Gemini API Error (Final Report):\', e);\\n      setFinalReport(`\347\224\237\346\210\220\345\244\261\346\225\227: ${e.message || \'\346\234\252\347\237\245\351\214\257\350\252\244\'}`);\\n    } finally {\\n      setIsGeneratingFinal(false);\\n    }\\n  };\",\"TargetContent\":\"  const generateFinalReport = async () => {\\n    if (chunks.length === 0 && !currentChunkText.trim()) return;\\n    setIsGeneratingFinal(true);\\n    const parts: any[] = [{ text: `\350\253\213\346\240\271\346\223\232\344\273\245\344\270\213\350\263\207\350\250\212\347\224\242\345\207\272\347\265\220\346\247\213\345\214\226\346\234\203\350\255\260\347\264\200\351\214\204\357\274\232\\\\n\\\\n` }];\\n    chunks.forEach((c, i) => {\\n      if (c.audio) {\\n        parts.push({ text: `\343\200\220\345\210\206\346\256\265 ${i + 1}\343\200\221\\\\n\346\221\230\350\246\201\357\274\232${c.summary}\\\\n` });\\n        parts.push({ inlineData: { mimeType: c.audio.mimeType, data: c.audio.data } });\\n      } else {\\n        parts.push({ text: `\343\200\220\345\210\206\346\256\265 ${i + 1}\343\200\221\\\\n\345\205\247\345\256\271\357\274\232${c.text}\\\\n\346\221\230\350\246\201\357\274\232${c.summary}\\\\n` });\\n      }\\n    });\\n    try {\\n      const response = await ai.models.generateContent({\\n        model: \'gemini-3.1-pro-preview\',\\n        contents: { parts },\\n        config: { systemInstruction: SYSTEM_PROMPT }\\n      });\\n      setFinalReport(response.text || \'\');\\n    } catch (e: any) {\\n      console.error(\'Gemini API Error (Final Report):\', e);\\n      setFinalReport(`\347\224\237\346\210\220\345\244\261\346\225\227: ${e.message || \'\346\234\252\347\237\245\351\214\257\350\252\244\'}`);\\n    } finally {\\n      setIsGeneratingFinal(false);\\n    }\\n  };\"},{\"ReplacementContent\":\"                <p className=\\\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-2\\\">{chunk.text}</p>\\n                {chunk.transcript && (\\n                  <div className=\\\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500 bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 max-h-32 overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"font-bold mb-1 text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">\351\200\220\345\255\227\347\250\277\345\205\247\345\256\271</div>\\n                    {chunk.transcript}\\n                  </div>\\n                )}\\n                {chunk.summary && <div className=\\\"p-2 bg-indigo-50 rounded text-sm font-medium text-indigo-900 mt-2\\\">{chunk.summary}</div>}\\n              </div>\",\"TargetContent\":\"                <p className=\\\"text-sm text-slate-600 mb-2\\\">{chunk.text}</p>\\n                {chunk.summary && <div className=\\\"p-2 bg-slate-50 rounded text-sm font-medium\\\">{chunk.summary}</div>}\\n              </div>\"}],\"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\",\"toolSummary\":\"Implement transcription-first workflow and full transcript analysis.\"}"
