  checkpoint {
    user_intent: "Audio Model Not Found Fix\n\nThe user\'s primary goal is to fix the `404 NOT_FOUND` error related to the audio model. They want to ensure the audio transcription process uses a valid and supported Gemini model, specifically `gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-09-2025`, to accurately convert audio segments into text transcripts. This is a prerequisite for the subsequent step of analyzing the full transcript to generate a structured meeting report."
    intent_only: true
