lity. After reviewing, and parsing the request in Chinese, I realize the user meant for me to not use 2.5 flash. Therefore, I will try a different model to avoid the issue. The goal is to use `gemini-2.0`. I\'m going to test `gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-09-2025` again, and also keep in mind that I should use `gemini-2.0-flash-exp` if the former falters. I see the user\'s request: \"\350\252\236\351\237\263\350\275\211\346\226\207\345\255\227\351\200\231\344\270\200\351\232\216\346\256\265,\350\253\213\345\260\210\345\277\203\347\224\250gemini 2\347\232\204\346\250\241\345\236\213\345\256\214\346\210\220,\344\270\215\350\246\201\347\224\2502.5 flash\", which might mean they prefer `gemini-2.0-flash-exp`!\n\n\n"
