stigate how the specific audio designator works with models.\n\n\n**Clarifying User Intent**\n\nI\'m now focusing on reconciling the user\'s conflicting instructions and the error messages. The previous model used in the `googleMaps` example was `gemini-2.5-flash`. I recall the user\'s canceled request specified *not* to use `gemini-2.5-flash`, which is a key conflict, especially when they mention `gemini-2.5`. The `v1main` error suggests a model ID issue, and I\'ll focus on resolving that.\n\n```text\nI\'ve pivoted to understanding the intent behind the user\'s canceled message and error messages. I will now try `gemini-3-flash-preview` as it\'s the most modern. The previous trials, including `gemini-2.5-flash`, failed or conflicted with instructions. I\'ll test `gemini-2.5-flash` because it\'s in the docs, and address the `v1main` error, if any.\n```\n\n"
