  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing FFmpeg Logic**\n\nI\'ve examined the FFmpeg loading logic, and it seems robust. I\'ve noted a minor detail regarding `libmp3lame`: it\'s not always present, but the `mp3` muxer usually is. My plan is to fallback to `copy` or a simpler encoder if `libmp3lame` is missing, although I\'d prefer `libmp3lame`.\n\n\n"
