  user_input {
    user_response: "Uploading an audio file causes the browser to crash or freeze in an infinite loop. Please completely review `handleFileUpload` and your audio decoding/slicing functions. Remove any `while` loops or synchronous recursive functions that could be causing an infinite loop. Ensure that when you chunk the audio, you are doing it asynchronously (e.g., using `setTimeout` or Web Workers if necessary, or just avoid complex memory-heavy operations on the main thread). Simplify the logic: just read the audio file and send it to Gemini in reasonable chunks without doing heavy byte-level manipulation that freezes the UI. Apply the fix and simplify."
    items {
      text: "Uploading an audio file causes the browser to crash or freeze in an infinite loop. Please completely review `handleFileUpload` and your audio decoding/slicing functions. Remove any `while` loops or synchronous recursive functions that could be causing an infinite loop. Ensure that when you chunk the audio, you are doing it asynchronously (e.g., using `setTimeout` or Web Workers if necessary, or just avoid complex memory-heavy operations on the main thread). Simplify the logic: just read the audio file and send it to Gemini in reasonable chunks without doing heavy byte-level manipulation that freezes the UI. Apply the fix and simplify."
    }
